{"seq":1,"slug":"isoperimetric","title":"等周与约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/calculus-of-variations/constraints/isoperimetric","wordCount":1284,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"等周与约束\">等周与约束</h1><p>公元前九世纪，腓尼基公主狄多（Dido）逃到北非海岸，当地国王戏谑地答应「一张牛皮能圈多大地就给多大」。狄多把牛皮割成细条接成长绳，问题立刻变成：周长固定时，什么形状围出最大面积？传说她选了半圆（靠海岸那侧不用绳），建起了迦太基城。这个「周长固定求最大面积」的问题叫等周问题，是带约束变分法的原型。它与前两章「自由」的极值问题有本质区别：你不能在所有曲线里随便挑，只能在「满足某个积分约束」的曲线里挑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-等周问题的标准形态\">核心概念：等周问题的标准形态</h2><p>等周问题的现代写法是：在约束</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>常数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G[y]=\\int_a^b g(x,y,y&#x27;)\\,dx=\\ell\\quad(\\text{常数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.511em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.599em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">常数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>之下，求泛函</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J[y]=\\int_a^b F(x,y,y&#x27;)\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.511em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.599em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>的极值。注意这里有「两个」积分泛函：一个是要优化的目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span>，一个是要保持不变的约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>。经典等周问题里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 是围成的面积、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是周长且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 是给定周长，答案是圆（闭曲线情形）或圆弧（端点固定情形）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>目标泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span>（极大化）</th>\n<th>约束泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>经典等周（闭曲线）</td>\n<td>面积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∮</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∮</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>周长固定</td>\n<td>圆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>狄多问题（直海岸）</td>\n<td>面积</td>\n<td>绳长固定</td>\n<td>半圆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>悬链线</td>\n<td>重力势能（极小）</td>\n<td>链长固定</td>\n<td>双曲余弦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大体积旋转面</td>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td>表面积固定</td>\n<td>球冠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行揭示了一个伏笔：<a href=\"../euler-lagrange/classic-problems\">经典问题</a> 里自然下垂的悬链线，其实是一个等周问题——「在链长固定的约束下让重心最低」，所以它的形状不能靠无约束的欧拉-拉格朗日方程直接得出，必须用约束方法，这正是本章存在的理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么不能直接套欧拉-拉格朗日方程\">为什么不能直接套欧拉-拉格朗日方程</h2><p>一个自然的诱惑：直接对目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 写欧拉-拉格朗日方程，不就行了？不行，而且错得很彻底。原因在于约束破坏了扰动的自由度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;无约束问题&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;扰动 η 任意&lt;br/&gt;(只需端点归零)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;δJ=0 对所有 η&lt;br/&gt;→ 基本引理 → EL 方程&quot;]&#10;  D[&quot;等周约束问题&quot;] --&gt; E[扰动必须保持 G[y]=ℓ&lt;br/&gt;即 δG=0&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;可用扰动受限&lt;br/&gt;不能套基本引理&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;引入乘子 λ&lt;br/&gt;构造增广泛函 J - λG&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;对 J-λG 写 EL 方程&lt;br/&gt;(下一篇)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"无约束问题\"] --&gt; B[\"扰动 η 任意&lt;br/&gt;(只需端点归零)\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"δJ=0 对所有 η&lt;br/&gt;→ 基本引理 → EL 方程\"]\n  D[\"等周约束问题\"] --&gt; E[扰动必须保持 G[y]=ℓ&lt;br/&gt;即 δG=0\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"可用扰动受限&lt;br/&gt;不能套基本引理\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"引入乘子 λ&lt;br/&gt;构造增广泛函 J - λG\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"对 J-λG 写 EL 方程&lt;br/&gt;(下一篇)\"]</pre><p><a href=\"../foundations/variation-concept\">变分概念</a> 推导基本引理时，关键前提是「扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 可以任意取」。但在等周问题里，被扰动后的曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y+\\varepsilon\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 还必须满足约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G[y+\\varepsilon\\eta]=\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>，这意味着只有那些保持约束的扰动（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta G=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）才是「容许的」。可用扰动的集合被压缩了，于是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta J=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span>」不再成立，基本引理失效。这与有限维优化里「在约束面上，可行方向受限，无约束的梯度为零不再是条件」是同一道理——那里的解药是拉格朗日乘子，这里也是。约束如何重塑可行集合，与 <a href=\"../../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/duality-theory\">优化理论</a> 中对偶视角下约束与可行域的关系一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多重约束与不等式约束\">多重约束与不等式约束</h2><p>实际问题常带不止一个约束。若有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立的积分约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_k[y]=\\ell_k\\,(k=1,\\dots,m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，处理方式是引入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个乘子，每个约束配一个，构造增广泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J-\\sum_k\\lambda_k G_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。约束之间需「独立」（类似有限维里约束梯度线性无关），否则乘子不唯一或问题退化。</p>\n<p>约束还可以是不等式型，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G[y]\\le\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>（绳长至多这么长）。这时借鉴有限维 <a href=\"../../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/kkt-conditions\">KKT 条件</a> 的互补松弛思想：要么约束「紧」（取等号，乘子非零、像等式约束那样起作用），要么约束「松」（严格不等，乘子为零、约束不影响解）。狄多若绳子有富余，最优解可能根本用不满绳长——这正是松约束的情形。完整的不等式约束变分理论更精细，本 hub 在 <a href=\"../practice/optimal-control\">最优控制</a> 里会再次遇到（控制变量受限的 bang-bang 现象）。</p>\n<p>等式约束与不等式约束的对照如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束类型</th>\n<th>数学形式</th>\n<th>乘子取值</th>\n<th>解的位置</th>\n<th>有限维类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等式约束</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G[y]=\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>一般为非零常数</td>\n<td>约束面上</td>\n<td>拉格朗日乘子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不等式（松）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G[y]&lt;\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>乘子为零</td>\n<td>约束内部</td>\n<td>KKT 互补松弛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不等式（紧）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G[y]=\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>（取等）</td>\n<td>乘子非零</td>\n<td>约束边界</td>\n<td>KKT 活跃约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"约束变分的现实回声\">约束变分的现实回声</h2><p>等周问题不是古董。表面张力让肥皂泡在固定体积下取最小表面积（球形），是等周不等式的物理实现；图像处理里的「全变差去噪」在数据保真约束下最小化变差泛函；机器学习中带正则项的训练，本质是「在拟合损失约束下控制模型复杂度」，与「目标 + 乘子 × 约束」的结构同构。识别出一个问题是「带积分约束的变分问题」，就等于拿到了通往乘子法的入场券——而乘子法正是 <a href=\"lagrange-multipliers-functional\">泛函拉格朗日乘子</a> 的主题，它把上面所有伏笔一次性兑现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>等周问题：在一个积分约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G[y]=\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span> 下求另一个泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J[y]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的极值，原型是「周长固定求最大面积 → 圆」。</li>\n<li>悬链线本质是等周问题（链长固定下重心最低），故不能用无约束欧拉-拉格朗日方程直接求。</li>\n<li>不能直接套基本引理，因为约束把可用扰动限制为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta G=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的那些，扰动不再自由。</li>\n<li>多约束引入多个乘子并要求约束独立；不等式约束借 <a href=\"../../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/kkt-conditions\">KKT</a> 的互补松弛思想（紧则乘子非零，松则乘子为零）。</li>\n<li>解决工具是下一篇 <a href=\"lagrange-multipliers-functional\">泛函拉格朗日乘子</a>：构造增广泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J-\\lambda G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 再用欧拉-拉格朗日方程。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"等周与约束","id":"等周与约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：等周问题的标准形态","id":"核心概念-等周问题的标准形态"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么不能直接套欧拉-拉格朗日方程","id":"为什么不能直接套欧拉-拉格朗日方程"},{"level":2,"text":"多重约束与不等式约束","id":"多重约束与不等式约束"},{"level":2,"text":"约束变分的现实回声","id":"约束变分的现实回声"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"经典问题 (最速降线/测地线)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/calculus-of-variations/euler-lagrange/classic-problems"},"next":{"title":"泛函拉格朗日乘子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/calculus-of-variations/constraints/lagrange-multipliers-functional"}}